creator: LinOnetwo
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

!!! 0.10.4

* Add scoped autocomplete search with actions to create tasks, projects and intentions.
* Configure autocomplete through WikiText using per-instance filters and action tiddlers, with a locally built upstream plugin in the demo.
* Keep generic journal entries outside the search scope and mark entries created from weekly planning with a dedicated tag.
* Place the standard-layout button beside search on wide screens and above it on narrow screens.
* Use adaptive column widths to fill the available space in the weekly planning table.
* Edit the selected entry's body above the weekly schedule, keeping its existing title.
* Format creation and modification dates using the wiki language and local time zone.
* Sort priorities by Low, Medium and High, and importance numerically, in both directions.
* Build table columns in one batch and share a date formatter across date columns.
* Support the core English language setting in table columns and search labels.
* Remove unused standalone creation buttons and the former title input component.
* Upgrade development dependencies and bundled community plugins, language packs and themes.

!!! 0.10.3

* Fix the task context background colour in dark mode.

!!! 0.10.2

* Add new ActionTiddlers: SetAsProject and SetAsTask, which add project and task tags to the current tiddler, respectively.
